        <p id="ks-ah-text">We present a GPU implementation of CKKS bootstrapping that keeps every stage on the device.</p>
      </div>
      <p class="ks-note"><button type="button" class="btn btn--ghost btn--small" onclick="var t=document.getElementById('ks-ah-text');var l=t.dataset.long==='1';t.dataset.long=l?'0':'1';t.textContent=l?'We present a GPU implementation of CKKS bootstrapping that keeps every stage on the device.':'We present a GPU implementation of CKKS bootstrapping that keeps every stage on the device. Key switching is fused with the number-theoretic transform, so the ciphertext stays in shared memory between stages, and the rotation keys are generated on the fly instead of being read from global memory. On one A100 the full bootstrapping takes a fraction of the time of the best published multi-GPU result, and the code is open source.'">Toggle the abstract</button></p>
